OL,3,GNEWSA'My son wouldn't leave his bed now
OL,4,Ahe's an esports star'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJoshua Berry sits alone in his
OL,7,Fpreferred corner at the back of the
OL,8,Fclassroom.
OL,10,F"It's a little bit away from people,"
OL,11,Fexplains the teenager who was diagnosed
OL,12,Fas autistic from a young age.
OL,14,FIn front of him is a large computer
OL,15,Fscreen showing a racing car on the
OL,16,Fstarting grid. He leans back in the
OL,17,Fgaming chair and picks up a control
OL,18,Fpad.
